config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_325_SILVER_GUARDIAN_HUB
	bool "Silver Guardian Hub (elderly care)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable Silver Guardian Hub application for elderly care.

		Core features:
		- Event processing system
		- Audio playback (TTS)
		- Medication reminder
		- Cloud communication
		- LCD/LVGL UI (clock, SOS / sitting / medication alerts)

		Note: enable LV_FONT_SIMSUN_16_CJK for Chinese UI text.
